                            <comment id="16096285" author="dpavlov" created="Fri, 21 Jul 2017 14:03:40 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;Under fix of &lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-5489&quot; title=&quot;Possible connection leaks when loadPreviousValue set to true&quot; class=&quot;issue-link&quot; data-issue-key=&quot;IGNITE-5489&quot;&gt;&lt;del&gt;IGNITE-5489&lt;/del&gt;&lt;/a&gt; within PR &lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/apache/ignite/pull/2288/files&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;https://github.com/apache/ignite/pull/2288/files&lt;/a&gt; &lt;br/&gt;
code was changed assigning null to tx, and assertion (having side effect) failed. Asertion was already removed in  &lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-5489&quot; title=&quot;Possible connection leaks when loadPreviousValue set to true&quot; class=&quot;issue-link&quot; data-issue-key=&quot;IGNITE-5489&quot;&gt;&lt;del&gt;IGNITE-5489&lt;/del&gt;&lt;/a&gt; for previous versions.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Assertion is to be removed under current issue PR&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
