                            <comment id="16105100" author="dpavlov" created="Fri, 28 Jul 2017 15:22:19 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;Passing after merge &lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-5858&quot; title=&quot;Ignite Cache 5 Timeout: CacheLateAffinityAssignmentTests hangs after assertion error&quot; class=&quot;issue-link&quot; data-issue-key=&quot;IGNITE-5858&quot;&gt;&lt;del&gt;IGNITE-5858&lt;/del&gt;&lt;/a&gt;, The only one known problem remained &lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-5759&quot; title=&quot;IgniteCache 6 suite timed out by GridCachePartitionEvictionDuringReadThroughSelfTest.testPartitionRent&quot; class=&quot;issue-link&quot; data-issue-key=&quot;IGNITE-5759&quot;&gt;&lt;del&gt;IGNITE-5759&lt;/del&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
